    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i'm finding that in some of my preliminary research, a lot of the pushback seems to be categorized just as \"NIMBYism\" or being against progress. do you think that's a fair assessment of why people oppose these things, or is there actually deeper logic behind their concerns that people usually overlook?",
